        "id": "owt-owt_v2_elf_m_64_nfe-5663500f2d51-000483",
        "sourceId": 483,
        "text": "If you’re traveling around the country, there are countless different ways to view the city, from abandoned buildings and studio walls that dated from the 1870s onward to the 1940s, to the historic Henry Letterman Building, which served as a site for construction of the first English Public School. It can be a fun place to view a partially-moved old building from foot in the sky. There is work ongoing on the rearfitment, renovation and preservation of the Letterman Building. It is also a very comfortable place to visit a city building that was partially abandoned in the 1980s. If you can find business opportunities right down the road, take a quick tour of the Letterman Building north of Capitol Hill. The Letterman Building is complete with a network of offices, companies, restaurants and shops around the area. What is AOS? What is AOS at Google? AOS is an open source research and development software studio, sometimes referred to Google as AOS Studio, with a focus on software development. AOS’s founder Matt Chapman says his career has been working for Samsung, Phillips, IBM, Digital Intel and HTC. In 2007, AOS started on a mission of supplying open source software development tools. Today, AOS provides a wide array of open source software development tools that can be used to design, test and improve features of user-developed software. Where do you get jobs at AOS? AOS Studio is an advanced open source research and development studio. Here’s a look at the list of open source jobs available to researchers at AOS. The positions include: Write code to common web standards. Create or contribute new versions of code. Develop a unique Python vocabulary by categorizing, localizing and sorting. Study a wide array of code and use Python for vocabulary analysis.  Develop and work on non-binding vocabulary. Develop and write Python to understand C++ dependencies. Use and use Python to provide a user-friendly software development environment. How does AOS work? When did Google first create a open source software development studio? AOS is a product of Google’s goal to create a studio dedicated to developing tools and tools in open software development. In 2009, Google created an IT startup called OpenStribell to turn what OpenStribell started into a open source research studio with a wide array of advanced software development systems, tools and applications. The company wanted to address this problem by being successful with a strong open source software development environment, with round-the-clock staff. The main task of the studio is to work with developers at the software project to help create design projects. The second level consist of chemists, software engineers and software developer students. The main task of the developers at the studio is to teach open source software development tools as well as provide a learning centre on developing open-source software for design projects. In addition to the strong open source software development environment, the studio is primarily focused on bug fixing, tool research and developing user applications. Who would you like to get AOS at Google? Tell us in the comments. San Francisco 49ers' buy Atlanta Falcons wide receiver Jason Cruz (41) passes in the fourth quarter during the first leg of the NFC College Football Playoff against the Green Bay Packers in Atlanta, California, on Oct. 25, 2017. San Francisco (Photo: Michael McElane/Folk Elgacki/AFP/Getty Images) QB Trimon Thompson is out for the start of the 2015 season with a left knee injury, but the 49ers announced Thursday that he won't play as a quarterback for the rest of the 2016-17 season. \"A lot of these guys are better athletic than Trimon Thompson is,\" Cruz said. \"It's always great to watch. I expect his performance to improve. He's done an incredibly nice job and I'm really excited to now have him back with our team. We've had a couple of quarterbacks in camp where a few more are going to be out there and I'm excited to be a part of the team and obviously he's done an incredibly nice job and I'm really excited to now have him back with us. \"We've had quite a couple of quarterbacks in camp where a few more are going to be out there and I'm really excited to have him here and obviously he performs. I'm really excited to have him back with our team.\" The 49ers lost cornerback Danny Hidgson for the kick of the NFC North title game to a sprained bone of his left knee in Sunday's season loss to Atlanta. Thompson has recorded 931 tackles and 48 interceptions in 34 games for the 49ers this past season."
